  licensed under BSD-2-Clause (gateware/soc/cores/ad9361/LICENSE).

gateware/build_artifacts/vivado-2r2t/BOOT.bin
  Besides the plutosky-stream bitstream, the SD boot image contains the Zynq
  first-stage boot loader and the U-Boot boot loader extracted unmodified from
  the board vendor's stock SD card image. The first-stage boot loader is
  Xilinx-generated code under Xilinx's license terms. U-Boot is licensed
  under GPL-2.0.

kernel/out/zImage
  The Linux kernel built from the pinned kernel source with kernel/patches
  applied, licensed under GPL-2.0-only (kernel/COPYING).

kernel/out/rootfs.cpio.gz
  The PlutoSDR root file system from the board vendor's stock SD card image,
  repacked with the plutosky-stream daemon, its register map and init script.
  The programs and libraries it contains remain under their own licenses,
  including GPL-2.0 for BusyBox.

sdcard/
  The same boot image, kernel and root file system as above, wrapped in u-boot
  image headers for the SD card, under the same licenses.
